r against Whisenhunt, the Zebras are well-positioned to maintain pressure in the standings today. We will continue to track the status of **Chase Meidroth**, **Jacob Gonzalez**, **Hector Rodriguez**, **Luis Pena**, and **Pedro Ramirez** to ensure we aren't leaving production on the table should the lineup landscape shift mid-day.",
